    "detailed_description": "Game is set in an fantasy universe, on an island. Milo, the main protagonist is given a task to find his lost dog Buddy. Milo need\u2019s to overcome hardships and anxiety and become a stronger person in order to reunite with Buddy. But at the moment he thinks that his adventure is over, something happens that makes things a lot more complicated. Help our protagonist solve cognitive puzzles and enjoy the world filled with audio and visual stimulants that can make you feel like you are reading a fable.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features:<br />\r\n-For fans of Journey, The first tree and Firewatch.<br />\r\n-Game filled with audio and visual stimulants that can make you feel relaxed <br />\r\n-A short game focused on story and puzzle solving.",
